:: Mine Punishment
<<effects>>

The <<person>> pulls you through the tunnels. <<He>> grumbles the whole way.
<br><br>
<<if $rng gte 51>>
	You're eventually handed over to two guards. Without a word, they grab your arms and drag you through another tunnel.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Intro]]>><<generate1>><<generate2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Intro]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Intro
<<effects>><<mine_pit>><<person1>>

You're dragged into a room with several grates in the ground.
<<if _coveredPits is 1>>
	<span class="blue">1</span> of the grates is covered with a tarp.
<<elseif _coveredPits gte 2>>
	<span class="blue">_coveredPits</span> of them are covered with tarps.
<<else>>
	"I guess we're spoiled for choice," the <<person>> chuckles.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit _pits.pluck()]]>><<endevent>><</link>>




:: Mine Punishment Pit Nothing
<<effects>>

They pull you up to one of the grates, open it and shove you in. You fall a few feet onto the hard rock. <<ggpain>><<pain 5>>
<br><br>
You look up and see the guards pulling a tarp over the grate, plunging you into darkness. <<ggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
Silence befalls you. The only things that accompany you are your own thoughts. You reflect on everything that has brought you to this moment. <<gggstress>><<stress 100>>
<br><br>
You think about your life and wonder if you'll ever be free of Bailey's torment. <<gggtrauma>><<trauma 25>>
<br><br>
You think about the other orphans in the same situation as you. <<gggtrauma>><<trauma 25>>

<br><br>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Mine Punishment Pit End]]>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>>
<<if $trauma gte 2500>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Cry|Mine Punishment Pit Nothing Cry]]>><<trauma -25>><</link>><<llltrauma>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Nothing Cry
<<effects>>

<span class="red">It's all too much</span>, you start to break down in tears. You hear the guards outside start to laugh at your misery. <<ggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
Eventually they get tired of it and stop laughing. Despite everything, you feel better having let it all out. <<llltrauma>><<trauma -50>>

<br><br>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Mine Punishment Pit End]]>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Slimes
<<effects>>

They pull you up to one of the grates, open it and shove you in. You fall a few feet and land in a puddle of slime.
<br><br>
You look up and see the guards pulling a tarp over the grate, plunging you into darkness. <<ggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
You try to scrape the slime off of you <span class="red">but it doesn't come off.</span> As you keep trying to get rid of it, <span class="red">you feel something move in the slime.</span>
<br><br>
You look down to try and see what it is, but it's too dark. You feel something press up against you.

<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Slimes Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Slimes Rape
<<effects>>

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>

	<<set $enemytype to "swarm">>

	<<swarminit "slimes" "slime mass" "moving towards you" "encircle you" "fend off" 4 2>>
	<<set $timer to 8>>
<</if>>

<<swarmeffects>>

<<swarm>>

<<swarmactions>>

<<if $timer lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Slimes Rape Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Slimes Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Slimes Rape Finish
<<effects>>

The slimes retreat away from you. <<tearful>> you're left in the dark to your own thoughts.

<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Mine Punishment Pit End]]>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles
<<effects>>

They pull you up to one of the grates, open it and shove you in. You fall a few feet onto the hard rock. <<ggpain>><<pain 5>>
<br><br>
You look up and see the guards pulling a tarp over the grate, plunging you into darkness. <<ggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
You sit in the dark and try to take your mind off everything, <span class="red">but you're interrupted by something soft touching your arm.</span>
<br><br>
You recoil your arm and turn to look. You see several tentacles emerging from cracks in the wall.
<br><br>
<<link [[Struggle|Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles Rape
<<effects>>

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "tentacles">>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>

	<<tentaclestart 6 12>>

<</if>>
<<water>>
<<waterbr 1>>
<<statetentacles>>

<<effects>>
<<effectstentacles>>
<<tentacles>>
<<actionstentacles>>

<<if $tentacles.active lte ($tentacles.max / 2)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles Rape Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Tentacles Rape Finish
<<effects>>

The tentacles retreat back into the crack. <<tearful>> you're left in the dark to your own thoughts.

<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Mine Punishment Pit End]]>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Spiders
<<effects>>

They pull you up to one of the grates, open it and shove you in. You fall a few feet and land in a giant web. A bunch of spiders almost immediately start walking across your skin.
<br><br>
You look up and see the guards pulling a tarp over the grate, plunging you into darkness. <<ggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
You try to brush the spiders off your skin, but the largest ones remain on you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Struggle|Mine Punishment Pit Spiders Swarm]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Spiders Swarm
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<set $bus to "danube">>

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "swarm">>
	<<swarminit "spiders" "sac" "slipping" "break" "steady" 1 9>>
	<<set $timer to 15>>
<</if>>

<br><br>

<<swarmeffects>>
<<swarm>>
<<swarmactions>>

<<if $timer lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Spiders Swarm Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Pit Spiders Swarm]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit Spiders Swarm Finish
<<effects>>

The spiders retreat away from you<<if $tending gte 300>>, intending on saving you for later<</if>>. <<tearful>> you're left in the dark to your own thoughts.

<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Mine Punishment Pit End]]>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Pit End
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

After a while of waiting, the tarp is pulled off, and a length of rope is dropped down. You don't hesitate to climb it out of the hole.
<br><br>
<<mine_punishment_end>>
